Recovery.

64
00:03:15.283 --> 00:03:17.364
Now let's listen to a conversation.

65
00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:20.734
Mr. Jake, I want to get fitter. What should I do?

66
00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.259
You should exercise three times a week.

67
00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:26.888
Should I warm up first?

68
00:03:28.183 --> 00:03:30.984
Yes, you should always warm up and stretch.

69
00:03:32.283 --> 00:03:33.250
What else?

70
00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:38.990
You should hydrate and eat a balanced diet. And rest if you have an injury.

71
00:03:40.283 --> 00:03:42.968
Grammar focus: Advice with should.

72
00:03:43.268 --> 00:03:45.186
You should warm up before exercise.

73
00:03:45.486 --> 00:03:49.021
Ask for advice with 'What should I do?' and answer with 'You should ...'.

74
00:03:50.017 --> 00:03:52.495
Now read and listen. Fit and Strong.

75
00:03:52.795 --> 00:03:55.607
Before exercise, I always warm up and stretch.

76
00:03:56.917 --> 00:04:00.495
Running builds my stamina and endurance, and push-ups build strength.

77
00:04:01.783 --> 00:04:04.340
I hydrate with water and eat a balanced diet.

78
00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:08.335
I also think about my posture when I sit and study.

79
00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:13.229
Last year, I hurt my ankle, and rest helped my recovery.

80
00:04:14.517 --> 00:04:16.856
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

81
00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:19.271
You blank warm up before exercise.

82
00:04:19.571 --> 00:04:22.621
A, should. B, shoulds. C, should to.

83
00:04:26.617 --> 00:04:28.686
The answer is A: should.

84
00:04:30.183 --> 00:04:32.113
The ability to bend easily is blank.

85
00:04:32.413 --> 00:04:36.473
A, flexibility. B, posture. C, injury.

86
00:04:40.483 --> 00:04:43.098
The answer is A: flexibility.

87
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:47.129
To drink water so your body has enough is to blank.

88
00:04:47.429 --> 00:04:51.570
A, hydrate. B, stretch. C, recover.

89
00:04:55.583 --> 00:04:57.513
The answer is A: hydrate.

90
00:04:59.017 --> 00:05:02.064
Now it's your turn to speak. What do you do to stay fit?

91
00:05:07.364 --> 00:05:13.478
I play badminton twice a week. I always warm up first, and I drink lots of water. You should try it!

92
00:05:13.778 --> 00:05:15.383
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

93
00:05:16.383 --> 00:05:20.777
Great work today! You learned twelve new words and advice with should.

94
00:05:21.077 --> 00:05:25.320
Today's value is perseverance. Keep trying, even when it is hard.

95
00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:28.110
See you in Unit seven. Goodbye!

96
00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:31.202
